                                "sense_id": "93fb286a-c1d9-3a12-97cc-8639e1a9ec11",
                                "text": "As Oscar turned to greet Yvonne, she could see every muscle in his body contract in anger. Then he detonated. “What the hell are you doing here without an appointment? […]"
